ained into tokens, cards, and winning the game\",keywords:[\"whenever you gain life\",\"you gained life this turn\",\"pay.*life\",\"life.*greater.*starting\"]},{name:\"Angel Lifegain\",description:\"Deploy angels that gain life and reward you for gaining it\",keywords:[\"angel\",\"flying\",\"lifelink\",\"angel.*enters\",\"whenever.*angel\"]},{name:\"Drain\",description:\"Drain opponents' life totals while padding your own\",keywords:[\"each opponent loses\",\"drain\",\"you gain.*life.*opponent.*loses\",\"extort\",\"whenever.*loses life\"]}],keywords:[\"gain.*life\",\"life.*gain\",\"whenever you gain life\",\"lifelink\",\"each opponent loses\",\"you gain\"]},{id:\"tokens\",name:\"Tokens\",description:\"Overwhelm opponents with massive token armies and anthem effects\",icon:\"👥\",subArchetypes:[{name:\"Go Wide\",description:\"Flood the board with tokens and swing for lethal\",keywords:[\"create.*token\",\"creature token\",\"for each creature\",\"number of creatures\",\"whenever.*create.*token\"]},{name:\"Anthems\",description:\"Buff your entire army with global +1/+1 effects\",keywords:[\"creatures you control get \\\\+\",\"anthem\",\"all creatures.*get\",\"each creature you control\"],searchTerms:[\"creatures you control get\",\"human soldier\"]},{name:\"Populate\",description:\"Copy your best tokens to multiply your army\",keywords:[\"populate\",\"copy.*token\",\"create a copy\",\"token copy\",\"whenever.*populate\"]},{name:\"Convoke\",description:\"Tap creatures to cast powerful spells for free\",keywords:[\"convoke\",\"tap.*untapped creature\",\"improvise\",\"tap.*creature.*add\",\"creature.*reduce\"]}],keywords:[\"token\",\"create\",\"creature token\",\"anthem\",\"+1/+1\",\"all creatures\",\"populate\",\"amass\",\"afterlife\",\"fabricate\",\"embalm\"]},{id:\"burn\",name:\"Burn\",description:\"Deal direct damage to opponents and their creatures\",icon:\"🔥\",subArchetypes:[{name:\"Direct Damage\",description:\"Point burn spells at faces for fast, efficient kills\",